<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cricket-Pakistan v West Indies scoreboard.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-Pakistan v West Indies scoreboard.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in the World Series limited overs match between West Indies and Pakistan at the WACA ground on Friday.</p>
<p>Pakistan</p>
<p> Aamir Sohail c Hooper b Walsh	    9</p>
<p> Zahoor Elahi c Griffith b Adams	 32</p>
<p> Mohammad Wasim c Lara b Chanderpaul   53</p>
<p> Ijaz Ahmed run out			  94</p>
<p> Shahid Afridi st Murray b Hooper	29</p>
<p> Wasim Akram c Adams b Thompson	  10</p>
<p> Moin Khan c Adams b Walsh		  5</p>
<p> Mujahid Jamshed not out		    3</p>
<p> Ijaz Ahmed Junior not out		  3</p>
<p> Extras (lb-7 w-8 nb-4)		    19</p>
<p>Total (for seven wickets, 50 overs)  257</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-14, 2-71, 3-151, 4-200, 5-245, 6-247, 7-252.</p>
<p>Did not bat: Saqlain Mustaq, Mohammed Zahid.</p>
<p>Bowling: Walsh 10-2-38-2 (w-1 nb-1), Bishop 9-1-60-0 (w-4), Hooper 10-1-38-1 (w-1), Thompson 9-1-46-1 (w-2 nb-3), Adams 9-1-52-1, Chanderpaul 3-0-16-1.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
